---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - Cosmetiqly" description="Cosmetiqly Terms of Service and Medical Disclaimer regarding cosmetic INCI safety checks.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold font-outfit text-white mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>Last updated: August 2, 2026</p>
      <p>Welcome to <strong>Cosmetiqly.com</strong>. By accessing or using our website, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-6">1. Educational & Informational Use Only</h2>
      <p>The content, safety scores, ingredient parsing algorithms, and safety verdicts on Cosmetiqly.com are provided strictly for educational and informational purposes. Cosmetiqly does not provide medical diagnoses, treatment plans, or professional medical advice.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-6">2. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>Cosmetiqly and its owners shall not be held liable for any skin reactions, adverse side effects, or decisions made based on the information provided on this website. Users must always patch test products and consult a licensed physician or dermatologist.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-6">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>All database algorithms, design elements, UI templates, and synthesized evaluations on Cosmetiqly.com are protected by applicable intellectual property laws.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
